; Start of interlude 1 (chapter 3)

@goto .Beata

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

; close the website if it's open
@onCloseWebCommand

; open the chat window
@showPrinter Chat
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

@printer Chat
Maurice: noa
Maurice: noa
Maurice: noa
Maurice: Noanoanoanoa

; show choices
@choice "shut up." handler:ChatReply goto:.shut_up
@choice "what's up??" handler:ChatReply goto:.what's_up
@stop


; if the player chooses shut up
# shut_up
@printer Chat
Noa: ******* Maurice

; print dialogue
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: The fuck?
@goto .Continue


# what's_up
@printer Chat
Noa: what's up?
@goto .Continue


# Continue
; print chat
@printer Chat 
Maurice: Tahnk goodness youre still here
Maurice: you saw it already?

Noa: ?

Maurice: the web noa it
Maurice: it happened
Maurice: the *********************************
Maurice: ****

;  Black screen. HUMMING COMPUTER SFX STOP. BARKING DOGS SFX ON. 

@hideAll

@stopSfx Pc_hum_sfx
@sfx dog_bark_sfx


@wait 3

; show dialogue box
@showPrinter Dialogue 
@printer Dialogue hideOther!
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

Noa: Bloody hell.

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue

; Computer boosting noices. Fade in Welcome screen. Fade in the desktop screen. SFX HUMMING PC ON THE LOOP. MAIN MUSIC OST ON THE LOOP. PLAYER NOT IN CONTROL. Chat window opens. There is following message

@sfx Pc_Welcome_sfx
@wait 0.2

; fade in the welcome screen
@showUI WelcomeScreen

@wait 5

; fade in the desktop screen with pc hum on loop
@showUI Desktop
@sfx Pc_hum_sfx loop:true

; Play main music on the loop here when asset is ready


; open chat window
@showPrinter Chat
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@resetText Chat

@printer Chat
We detected suspicious activity.
You will be able to exchange messages again in 10 minutes.

; show dialogue box
@showPrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: Fuck.

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@hidePrinter Chat
@onDialogueClosedCommand

# Beata
; show beata
@printer Bubble.Left pos:-5,70
@wait 0.5
@showPrinter Bubble
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Bubble.Left pos:40,70

Beata: Good morning! I’m Beata, your favorite virtual assistant!
Beata: I hope you’re enjoying your day!
Beata: Please, let me know if there’s anything I can help you with.


; show dialogue box
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "What the fuck?"
Noa: "How did you get on my computer?"

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue


@printer Bubble.Left
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@resetText Bubble

@wait 0.5
Beata: We’ve noticed that you don’t have Beata of your own!
Beata: According to the Online Safety Act, Clause 4(a), if you can’t install Beata, Daystar will do it for you!
Beata: I’m now fully integrated with your system. We’re going to be best friends forever!

; Beata disappears
@printer Bubble.Left pos:-10,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble
@onDialogueClosedCommand

; wait for a moment
@wait 1

; show dialogue box
@showPrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

@printer Dialogue
Noa: I should ignore it – and the itch to throw my computer out of the window – for now.
Noa: I need to contact Maurice.


@stop